<title>INDIA: Dunlop India's 1st half 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dunlop India's 1st half 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-September</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     185.2 vs    53.9</p>
<p>    Net sales	    3,363.7 vs 2,759.8</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  2,997.4 vs 2,571.7</p>
<p>    Interest		 122.7 vs   105.0</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   243.6 vs    83.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    30.9 vs    29.2</p>
<p>    Tax			 27.5 vs     nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Tyre maker Dunlop India Ltd said in a statement that &quot;the present trend shows a continued and healthy improvement in the operations and the year end is likely to see Dunlop India in the top bracket of the rubber products industry in the country&quot;.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
